OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F357A1786214541
OL,3,CCultural stigma prevents black women
OL,4,Caccessing menopause help
OL,6,FEthnic minority women in Jersey say
OL,7,Fthey are struggling to get the help
OL,8,Fthey need throughout the menopause,
OL,9,Fdue to a lack of education and
OL,10,Fcultural stigma.
OL,12,FTo try and change that, they came
OL,13,Ftogether to share their stories at an
OL,14,Fevent in St Helier, hosted by Eve
OL,15,FStudios and Liberty Underwear.
OL,17,FParticipants were encouraged to be
OL,18,Fopen about the symptoms they had
OL,19,Fexperienced.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/8
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,358,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F357A1786214541
OL,3,CCultural stigma prevents black women
OL,4,Caccessing menopause help
OL,6,FAngela Mowanga, from Jersey, told ITV
OL,7,FChannel, "I became dismissive about
OL,8,Fsigns and symptoms. From our parents
OL,9,Fand our grandparents, they just
OL,10,Fcarried on.
OL,12,F"I hardly heard the word menopause
OL,13,Fspoken about in my household. We never
OL,14,Fhad things like hot flushes, itchy
OL,15,Fskin and tiredness. So for us to start
OL,16,Ftalking about menopause, there is a
OL,17,Ftaboo around it. A taboo that comes
OL,18,Ffrom ignorance but also not being
OL,19,Fwilling to educate ourselves.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/8
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,358,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F357A1786214541
OL,3,CCultural stigma prevents black women
OL,4,Caccessing menopause help
OL,6,F"We as women of colour, societies of
OL,7,Fcolour, we have a lot of taboo
OL,8,Fsubjects, which now have to be
OL,9,Fhighlighted with the generation today.
OL,10,FHowever, with the modern day, society
OL,11,Fis changing. And we hope programmes
OL,12,Flike this can actually be well
OL,13,Freceived."
OL,15,FDaisy Ayebale, from Jersey, added, "I
OL,16,Fthink it's important we are listened
OL,17,Fto. We need the right information from
OL,18,Fthe experts, but we have also been
OL,19,Foverlooked when it comes to the
OL,20,Fhealthcare system.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G3/8
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,358,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F357A1786214541
OL,3,CCultural stigma prevents black women
OL,4,Caccessing menopause help
OL,6,F"We need to know this information
OL,7,Fbefore it's too late, before you're
OL,8,Fgambling with your health. We are glad
OL,9,Fto be changing the narrative, we are
OL,10,Fglad to be changing things right now.
OL,11,FWe are very hopeful."
OL,13,FResearch shows that black women are
OL,14,Fmore likely to start having menopausal
OL,15,Fsymptoms earlier and often more
OL,16,Fintensely, for longer.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G4/8
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,358,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F357A1786214541
OL,3,CCultural stigma prevents black women
OL,4,Caccessing menopause help
OL,6,FLocal gynecologist, Dr Christian
OL,7,FAlabi, believes part of the reason
OL,8,Fethnic minorities in Jersey struggle
OL,9,Fto get the medical care they need is
OL,10,Fbecause of the status that comes with
OL,11,Fbeing a temporary worker.
OL,13,FHe explained, "In Jersey a lot of
OL,14,Fwoman are immigrants from Kenya,
OL,15,FZimbabwe. The visa they have is very
OL,16,Fsubjective. There's a visa that they
OL,17,Fhave for nine months, so they spend
OL,18,Fnine months in Jersey and have to go
OL,19,Fback to wherever they are from.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G5/8
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,358,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F357A1786214541
OL,3,CCultural stigma prevents black women
OL,4,Caccessing menopause help
OL,6,F"Let's say I get here in month one, my
OL,7,FGP wants to refer me to a doctor. By
OL,8,Fthe time it gets to six or seven
OL,9,Fmonths, we know that the waiting list
OL,10,Fis quite long, they're back to where
OL,11,Fthey're from. So they're not able to
OL,12,Fget the care they want at that time."
OL,14,FJersey's Assistant Health Minister,
OL,15,FDeputy Andy Howell, told ITV Channel,
OL,16,F"We know menopause can have a
OL,17,Fsignificant impact on some women's
OL,18,Flives and I want islanders to be
OL,19,Freassured that support is available.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G6/8
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,358,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35707
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F357A1786214541
OL,3,CCultural stigma prevents black women
OL,4,Caccessing menopause help
OL,6,F"Women with more complex symptoms,
OL,7,Fthat cannot be managed by a GP, can
OL,8,Faccess specialist clinics at Enid
OL,9,FQuenault with referrals prioritised
OL,10,Faccording to clinical need. There's
OL,11,Falso support through the Listening
OL,12,FLounge.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G7/8
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,358,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35708
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F357A1786214541
OL,3,CCultural stigma prevents black women
OL,4,Caccessing menopause help
OL,6,F"As we develop Jersey's Women's Health
OL,7,FStrategy, we are mindful that some
OL,8,Fwomen, particularly those from ethnic
OL,9,Fminority communities, can face
OL,10,Fadditional barriers to accessing
OL,11,Fsupport. This is not just a Jersey
OL,12,Fissue. We want all women in Jersey to
OL,13,Fbe aware of and able to access the
OL,14,Fcare and support they need."
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G8/8
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
